WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 3.2 · Structure, Governance & Accountability
Organisational structures and organigrams

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Draw the structure you start with and the one you expect as you grow, and change it on purpose.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Show governance apart from day-to-day management.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Use role names; dotted lines for partners and volunteers.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Draw only real roles, not empty boxes to look established.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You map your starting roles, reporting lines and capacity gaps.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
